source provenance is in gateway/web/vendor/winbox/provenance.json.

Workstation
-----------
Pinned application versions and artifact checksums: workstation/versions.env.
Tool installation sources: workstation/scripts/install-tools.sh and Dockerfile.
MCP dependency versions and package licenses: workstation/mcp/package-lock.json.
Unity MCP source revision, uv, optional Editor and Hub checksums:
workstation/unity/versions.env. Python dependency pins and artifact hashes:
workstation/unity/requirements.lock. The installed Unity bridge retains its
upstream MIT license at /opt/workstation/unity/UPSTREAM-LICENSE.
Claude identity reset rules: liseami/CCBaga (MIT), commit
bdfb90ceadfc5fae6772ffff597bddecb0b73cc3, cleaner_config.rs and cleaner_targets.rs.
The Linux adaptation retains the upstream license in
workstation/scripts/reset-claude-user.py.
Optional isolated DNS installation: workstation/scripts/configure-exit-dns.py
downloads AdGuard Home v0.107.79 (GPL-3.0) from its pinned upstream release,
checks archive and executable hashes, and retains LICENSE.txt beside the binary.
Source: https://github.com/AdguardTeam/AdGuardHome/tree/v0.107.79

